{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Recode</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. The rules don't stay the same. Neither do the walls, the halls, or your thoughts. If there's a pattern, it's not meant for you to understand.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Scary atmosphere!<br>- 1 to 4 player co-op<br>- Proximity voice chat<br>- Immersive AI<br>- Game Difficulties<br>- Stealth<br>- Large &amp; difficult map<br>- Primitive but challenging gameplay<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2>This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way.<br><br>The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801370?t=1755534983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801370/0f7d6861fe5aad02702ae515c63601146adf07d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755534983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801370/eff89ec63436c4832811f39b8a02d19eb2a3ef1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755534983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801370/eff89ec63436c4832811f39b8a02d19eb2a3ef1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755534983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Recode</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. The rules don't stay the same. Neither do the walls, the halls, or your thoughts. If there's a pattern, it's not meant for you to understand.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Scary atmosphere!<br>- 1 to 4 player co-op<br>- Proximity voice chat<br>- Immersive AI<br>- Game Difficulties<br>- Stealth<br>- Large &amp; difficult map<br>- Primitive but challenging gameplay<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2>This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way.<br><br>The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","developers":["Skmaestro"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801370/622b7e56370228a4dcc1735c54409f28ee827f0a/header.jpg?t=1755534983","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3801370/606001175/196599447f17703adfe1cc7